    {
      "bodyHtml": "<p>\n<strong>學習目標：</strong>依目前的運動習慣估算心率，找出願意嘗試的運動與困難，訂出下週的小目標。</p>\n<p>\n<strong>使用說明：</strong>把影片中「依體能調整強度」的概念用在自己身上：依序估算心率、選擇願意嘗試的運動，並設定下週的小目標。可以自己完成，也可以和輔導員討論；沒有標準答案。</p>\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<span class=\"section-number\">01</span>\n<h2>運動習慣</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"answer-field\">\n<label for=\"ep95-age\">我的年齡（歲）</label>\n<input id=\"ep95-age\" class=\"short-answer\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"120\" step=\"1\" inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-describedby=\"ep95-age-error\">\n\n</div><p class=\"example-note\">例如：20</p>\n<p id=\"ep95-age-error\" hidden role=\"status\">請填入 1～120 的整數年齡，才能估算心率。</p>\n<div class=\"answer-field\">\n<label for=\"ep95-rate\">估算最大心率＝220－年齡（下／分鐘，自動計算）</label>\n<input id=\"ep95-rate\" class=\"short-answer\" type=\"text\" readonly aria-live=\"polite\">\n</div>\n<p>心率數字僅供估算，實際強度仍須配合身體感受。</p>\n<div class=\"question-heading\">\n<h3>我目前的運動狀態</h3>\n<span class=\"answer-mode\">單選</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"choices choices-stacked\">\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-regular\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-habit\">\n<span>規律運動（每週運動時間&gt;150分鐘）</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-occasional\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-habit\">\n<span>偶爾運動</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-none\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-habit\">\n<span>幾乎不運動</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question-heading\">\n<h3>我屬於</h3>\n<span class=\"answer-mode\">單選</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"choices choices-stacked\">\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-intensity-70\" data-range-low=\"70\" data-range-high=\"80\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-intensity\">\n<span>有運動習慣，最適合最大心率的70~80%</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-intensity-60\" data-range-low=\"60\" data-range-high=\"70\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-intensity\">\n<span>沒有固定運動習慣，最適合最大心率的60~70%</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-intensity-50\" data-range-low=\"50\" data-range-high=\"60\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-intensity\">\n<span>幾乎沒在動、體能較低，最適合最大心率的50~60%</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"answer-field\">\n<label for=\"ep95-range\">所選比例的心率區間（下／分鐘，自動計算）</label>\n<input id=\"ep95-range\" class=\"short-answer\" type=\"text\" readonly aria-live=\"polite\">\n</div>\n<p>先填年齡，再選上方比例；心率區間＝估算最大心率×所選比例，四捨五入到整數。</p>",
      "footer": "運動完是清醒還是想睡？｜揭秘美國明星高中的大腦改造術"
    },
    {
      "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<span class=\"section-number\">02</span>\n<h2>我願意嘗試的運動</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question-heading\">\n<h3>低強度</h3>\n<span class=\"answer-mode\">可複選</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"choices choices-stacked\">\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-low-walk\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>每天散步10分鐘以上</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-low-jog\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>超慢跑</span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"choice other-choice\">\n<label class=\"choice-toggle\">\n<input id=\"ep95-low-other\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>其他</span>\n</label>\n<input class=\"other-input\" id=\"ep95-low-other-text\" type=\"text\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question-heading\">\n<h3>中強度</h3>\n<span class=\"answer-mode\">可複選</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"choices choices-stacked\">\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-mid-weight\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>重訓</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-mid-pilates\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>皮拉提斯</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-mid-yoga\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>瑜伽</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-mid-bike\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>飛輪</span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"choice other-choice\">\n<label class=\"choice-toggle\">\n<input id=\"ep95-mid-other\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>其他</span>\n</label>\n<input class=\"other-input\" id=\"ep95-mid-other-text\" type=\"text\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question-heading\">\n<h3>高強度</h3>\n<span class=\"answer-mode\">可複選</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"choices choices-stacked\">\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-high-ball\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>籃球</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-high-volley\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>排球</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-high-swim\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>游泳</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-high-dance\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>跳舞</span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"choice other-choice\">\n<label class=\"choice-toggle\">\n<input id=\"ep95-high-other\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>其他</span>\n</label>\n<input class=\"other-input\" id=\"ep95-high-other-text\" type=\"text\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<span class=\"section-number\">03</span>\n<h2>運動目的與困難點</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question-heading\">\n<h3>我認為運動對我的正向影響是</h3>\n<span class=\"answer-mode\">可複選</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"choices choices-stacked\">\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-goal-health\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>身體健康</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-goal-weight\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>減肥</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-goal-shape\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>體態</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-goal-rehab\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>復健</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-goal-mind\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>心理調適</span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"choice other-choice\">\n<label class=\"choice-toggle\">\n<input id=\"ep95-goal-other\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>其他</span>\n</label>\n<input class=\"other-input\" id=\"ep95-goal-other-text\" type=\"text\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question-heading\">\n<h3>對於不同型態的運動，我嘗試新運動的意願是</h3>\n<span class=\"answer-mode\">單選</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"choices choices-stacked\">\n<label class=\"choice\"><input id=\"ep95-willing-very\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-willing\"><span>非常願意</span></label>\n<label class=\"choice\"><input id=\"ep95-willing-some\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-willing\"><span>有點願意</span></label>\n<label class=\"choice\"><input id=\"ep95-willing-curious\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-willing\"><span>好奇但缺乏開始的動機</span></label>\n<label class=\"choice\"><input id=\"ep95-willing-none\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ep95-willing\"><span>完全不想</span></label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question-heading\">\n<h3>面對運動時，我會遇到的困難</h3>\n<span class=\"answer-mode\">可複選</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"choices choices-stacked\">\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-hard-company\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>缺少陪伴</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-hard-busy\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>生活很忙</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-hard-discomfort\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>運動完的不適感過高</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-hard-tool\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>缺乏器材</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-hard-expensive\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>花費太高</span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"choice other-choice\">\n<label class=\"choice-toggle\">\n<input id=\"ep95-hard-other\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>其他</span>\n</label>\n<input class=\"other-input\" id=\"ep95-hard-other-text\" type=\"text\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question-heading\">\n<h3>面對這種情況我可以</h3>\n<span class=\"answer-mode\">可複選</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"choices choices-stacked\">\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-solve-adjust\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>調整運動目標</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-solve-group\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>加入運動社群</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-solve-change\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>更改運動方式</span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"choice\">\n<input id=\"ep95-solve-tool\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>尋找替代器材</span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"choice other-choice\">\n<label class=\"choice-toggle\">\n<input id=\"ep95-solve-other\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<span>其他</span>\n</label>\n<input class=\"other-input\" id=\"ep95-solve-other-text\" type=\"text\">\n</div>\n</div>",
      "footer": "運動完是清醒還是想睡？｜揭秘美國明星高中的大腦改造術"
    },
    {
      "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<span class=\"section-number\">04</span>\n<h2>給自己一個小目標吧！</h2>\n</div>\n<p>分別填入下週的運動時間、運動名稱與目標比例。還不想開始時，時間可填 0，運動名稱可填「尚未決定」，比例先留白。</p>\n<div class=\"answer-field\">\n<label for=\"ep95-next-minutes\">下週我願意抽出的運動時間（分鐘）</label>\n<input id=\"ep95-next-minutes\" class=\"short-answer\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" inputmode=\"numeric\">\n\n</div><p class=\"example-note\">例如：30</p>\n<div class=\"answer-field\">\n<label for=\"ep95-next-sport\">我想試試的運動</label>\n<input id=\"ep95-next-sport\" class=\"short-answer\" type=\"text\">\n\n</div><p class=\"example-note\">例如：散步</p>\n<div class=\"answer-field\">\n<label for=\"ep95-next-percent\">目標是最大心率的百分之幾（％）</label>\n<input id=\"ep95-next-percent\" class=\"short-answer\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"any\" inputmode=\"decimal\" aria-describedby=\"ep95-percent-error\">\n\n</div><p class=\"example-note\">例如：60</p>\n<p id=\"ep95-percent-error\" hidden role=\"status\">請填入大於 0、且不超過 100 的比例，才能估算目標心率。</p>\n<div class=\"answer-field\">\n<label for=\"ep95-target-rate\">目標心率＝估算最大心率×目標比例（下／分鐘，自動計算）</label>\n<input id=\"ep95-target-rate\" class=\"short-answer\" type=\"text\" readonly aria-live=\"polite\">\n</div>\n<p>先填第 1 頁的年齡與這裡的目標比例，結果四捨五入到整數。</p>\n<div class=\"answer-field legacy-answer\" id=\"ep95-legacy\" data-reveal-when=\"#ep95-next\" hidden><label for=\"ep95-next\">先前暫存的小目標</label><textarea id=\"ep95-next\" rows=\"3\" readonly></textarea></div>\n<aside class=\"closing final-reminder no-arrow\">\n<p>從自己目前能承受的強度開始，才有機會讓運動變成可持續的習慣。</p>\n</aside>\n<aside class=\"closing prompt-intro\"><span class=\"closing-mark\">→</span><h2>AI 幫幫忙</h2><p>下方提示詞會帶入你前面的作答。複製到 AI 後，請它協助你安排下週可完成的運動小目標，請自行確認結果是否符合你的情況。</p></aside>\n<aside class=\"prompt-quote\">\n<div class=\"prompt-copy-text\" data-prompt-text>\n<p>我的年齡是【年齡】，目前運動狀態是【目前運動狀態】，我願意嘗試【願意嘗試的運動】；困難是【目前的困難】。請保留我的身體感受，協助我安排下週可完成的小目標。</p>\n</div>\n<button class=\"prompt-copy-button\" data-prompt-copy type=\"button\">複製提示詞</button>\n</aside>",
      "footer": "運動完是清醒還是想睡？｜揭秘美國明星高中的大腦改造術"
    }
  ]
}
